#: ../../docs/getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md:1
#: 2f79a5dfc3ea44f28dca9f550b811438
msgid "Start with SeCuReDmE Education in 15 minutes"
msgstr "Comenzar con SeCuReDmE Education en 15 minutos"

#: ../../docs/getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md:3
#: 99d4cda5b57c424289f1bbfbc60525cd
msgid ""
"This route teaches the shared operating method. It does not pretend that all"
" twelve tools have the same runtime."
msgstr ""
"Este recorrido ensena el metodo operativo comun. No pretende que las doce "
"herramientas utilicen el mismo entorno de ejecucion."

#: ../../docs/getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md:5
#: c4e9f920b1954f6895ed379ba2ad59bb
msgid "Minutes 0-3: choose a real surface"
msgstr "Minutos 0-3: elegir una superficie real"

#: ../../docs/getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md:7
#: cf0944c5df2e400b9f44d3787f66d0d8
msgid ""
"Open the [tool library](../tools/index.md). Select a browser application for"
" an interactive lesson, or a local, CLI, API, or research surface for "
"inspectable execution. Read the status and boundary before starting."
msgstr ""
"Abra la [biblioteca de herramientas](../tools/index.md). Elija una "
"aplicacion web para una actividad interactiva, o una superficie local, CLI, "
"API o de investigacion para una ejecucion inspeccionable. Lea el estado y el"
" limite antes de comenzar."

#: ../../docs/getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md:9
#: 688575799e4d4871ad238c9c4b732ec7
msgid "Minutes 3-7: inspect before installing"
msgstr "Minutos 3-7: inspeccionar antes de instalar"

#: ../../docs/getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md:11
#: 840283288deb4104841f218de9d8e7f1
msgid ""
"Open the selected tool's quickstart and source repository. In a clean "
"checkout, record the active branch and changes:"
msgstr ""
"Abra el inicio rapido y el repositorio fuente de la herramienta elegida. En "
"una copia limpia, registre la rama activa y los cambios:"

#: ../../docs/getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md:17
#: d6ba489541824c7ebda1a03fae2d44a7
msgid ""
"Use only the installation command committed by that tool. Never paste a "
"password, cookie, private token, or `.env` value into a prompt or tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Use solamente el comando de instalacion registrado por la herramienta. Nunca"
" coloque una contrasena, cookie, token privado o valor `.env` en un prompt o"
" tutorial."

#: ../../docs/getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md:19
#: 5ad6c5c156304617888495341be245c4
msgid "Minutes 7-12: run one bounded action"
msgstr "Minutos 7-12: ejecutar una accion acotada"

#: ../../docs/getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md:21
#: 4d00c113ed104267b093f7f5a4eae586
msgid ""
"Execute the smallest documented example. Keep the input, command, output "
"path, and test result together. A generated file, screenshot, or model "
"answer is a candidate artifact until the documented validation succeeds."
msgstr ""
"Ejecute el ejemplo documentado mas pequeno. Conserve juntos la entrada, el "
"comando, la ruta de salida y el resultado de prueba. Un archivo generado, "
"una captura o una respuesta del modelo sigue siendo un artefacto candidato "
"hasta que la validacion documentada tenga exito."

#: ../../docs/getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md:23
#: 80986009559a402896f290f05f7b3c17
msgid "Minutes 12-15: review and decide"
msgstr "Minutos 12-15: revisar y decidir"

#: ../../docs/getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md:25
#: 2f40aef87fa04fbaa1ec3688743c8fb3
msgid ""
"Inspect the result and choose `COMPLETED`, `NEEDS_INPUT`, `QUARANTINED`, or "
"`BLOCKED`. Stop before publishing, spending, deleting, changing remote "
"state, or promoting an unverified scientific or educational claim."
msgstr ""
"Inspeccione el resultado y elija `COMPLETED`, `NEEDS_INPUT`, `QUARANTINED` o"
" `BLOCKED`. Detengase antes de publicar, gastar, borrar, cambiar estado "
"remoto o promover una afirmacion cientifica o educativa no verificada."

